# Firebase / Google credentials.
# The service-account private key is a SECRET and lives outside this repo
# (F:\secrets\true-diet). google-services.json is a client config, not a
# secret, but it is kept local so no credential file is ever tracked.
google-services.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
*service_account*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

